Cell[TextData[{
 "work well enough on first application, but they fail to iterate; they wrap \
their output in braces {  }. Iteration requires, however, that those be \
removed (replaced by [  ]). Here I do so ",
 StyleBox["by hand",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 ", and get the anticipated result:"
}], "Text",
