\\\"], StyleBox[\\\"2\\\", \\\"TR\\\"]], \\\"\[Cross]\\\", StyleBox[\\\"\
\[Ellipsis]\\\", \\\"TR\\\"]}]\\) array of weighted choices.\"\>", "MSG"], 
