Cell["\<\
we see that that state of affairs is entirely typical; it reflects simply the \
fact that three of our 
e-directions are opposites of the other three.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.534710786304043*^9, 3.53471083577216*^9}, 
   3.5347108697846813`*^9, {3.53471252849572*^9, 3.534712528775375*^9}, {
